o de cambios","Compatibilidad con comentarios de revisión y disputas"],"fr":["Prise en charge de SSH et SFTP","Terminal intégré","Profils d''auteur personnalisables","Analyse des dépendances et de la taille des modifications","Compatibilité avec les commentaires de révision et les litiges"],"de":["Unterstützung für SSH und SFTP","Integrierter Terminal","Anpassbare Autorenprofile","Analyse von Abhängigkeiten und Änderungsgröße","Kompatibilität mit Review-Kommentaren und Streitigkeiten"],"pt":["Suporte a SSH e SFTP para gerenciamento de changelists","Perfil de autorização personalizável para ajustar a eficiência","Linguagem de saída em inglês para facilitar a comunicação","Entradas personalizáveis para proposta de mudança e impacto no usuário","Integração com fluxo de trabalho para definir e gerenciar changelists"],"ru":["Поддержка SSH и SFTP для управления changelists","Настраиваемый профиль авторизации для регулирования эффективности","Язык вывода на английском для облегчения коммуникации","Настраиваемые входные данные для предложения изменений и влияния на пользователя","Интеграция с рабочим процессом для определения и управления changelists"],"ar":["دعم SSH و SFTP لتحضير changelists","ملف تعريف التأليف قابل للتعديل لضبط الكفاءة","لغة الإخراج باللغة الإنجليزية لتسهيل الاتصال","مدخلات قابلة للتعديل لمقترح التغيير والتأثير على المستخدم","التكامل مع تدفق العمل لتحديد وإدارة changelists"]},"keywords":{"en":["how to use google-cl-author","google-cl-author setup guide","google-cl-author alternative","google-cl-author vs ssh-client","what is google-cl-author","google-cl-author install","google-cl-author for AI agents","google-cl-author and SFTP","google-cl-author changelist management"],"zh":["AIエージェント","代码审查工具","Google CL Author Skill","SSH","SFTP","代码审查","反馈响应","开发效率"],"ja":["AIエージェント","コードレビューツール","Google CL Author Skill","SSH","SFTP","コードレビュー","フィードバック対応","開発效率"],"ko":["AI 에이전트","코드 리뷰 도구","Google CL Author Skill","SSH","SFTP","코드 리뷰","피드백 응대","개발 효율"],"es":["google-cl-author","herramientas de AI para desarrolladores","gestión de listas de cambios","comentarios de revisión","SSH","SFTP","terminal","desarrollo de software"],"fr":["google-cl-author","outils IA pour développeurs","gestion des listes de modifications","commentaires de révision","SSH","SFTP","terminal","développement de logiciels"],"de":["google-cl-author","AI-Tools für Entwickler","Änderungslisten-Verwaltung","Review-Kommentare","SSH","SFTP","Terminal","Software-Entwicklung"],"pt":["google-cl-author","ferramenta de linha de comando","gerenciamento de changelists","respostas a feedback de revisão","SSH","SFTP","desenvolvimento de software","ferramentas de desenvolvimento"],"ru":["google-cl-author","командная утилита","управление changelists","ответы на отзывы рецензентов","SSH","SFTP","разработка программного обеспечения","инструменты разработки"],"ar":["google-cl-author","أداة سطر الأوامر","إدارة changelists","الرد على تعليقات المراجعين","SSH","SFTP","تطوير البرمجيات","أدوات التطوير"]}},"owner":"agoudbg","repo":"Cosmosh","repoPath":"agoudbg/Cosmosh","stars":3,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-03-07T11:45:21Z","topics":["agents","ai","bash","cmd","linux","macos","sftp","sftp-client","ssh","ssh-agent","ssh-client","ssh-key","ssh-key-manager","ssh-server","terminal","windows","windows-10","windows-11","zsh"],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"google-cl-author","description":"Prepare and iterate changelists/pull requests using Google-style author practices. Use when writing clear CL descriptions, splitting large changes, bundling tests, handling reviewer comments, and keeping dependent CLs build-safe.","bodyPreview":"# Google CL Author Skill\n\nUse this skill to prepare review-friendly changelists and respond to review feedback efficiently.\n\n## Default Mode\n- Authoring profile: `Balanced` (quality-first without perfection blocking).\n- Output language: English.\n\n## Inputs To Request\n- Proposed change summary and intended user/developer impact.\n- Current CL size (rough LOC/files) and dependency chain.\n- Test status and documentation impact.\n- Open reviewer comments and disputed points.\n\n## Workflow\n1. Define one","body":"# Google CL Author Skill\n\nUse this skill to prepare review-friendly changelists and respond to review feedback efficiently.\n\n## Default Mode\n- Authoring profile: `Balanced` (quality-first without perfection blocking).\n- Output language: English.\n\n## Inputs To Request\n- Proposed change summary and intended user/developer impact.\n- Current CL size (rough LOC/files) and dependency chain.\n- Test status and documentation impact.\n- Open reviewer comments and disputed points.\n\n## Workflow\n1. Define one self-contained change.\n- Keep CL focused on one conceptual change.\n- Separate pure refactors from behavior changes when review clarity benefits.\n\n2. Right-size the CL.\n- If CL is large, split by dependency stack, file groups, horizontal layers, vertical features, or combined matrix.\n- Keep each split independently understandable and reviewable.\n- Ensure each submitted step keeps build and tests healthy.\n\n3. Include tests with behavior changes.\n- Add or update tests in same CL for changed logic when feasible.\n- Verify tests fail on broken behavior and avoid brittle assertions.\n\n4. Write a high-quality CL description.\n- First line: short imperative summary of what changed.\n- Body: why, context, key trade-offs, limitations, links (bugs/design docs).\n- Avoid vague descriptions like \"fix bug\".\n\n5. Prepare reviewer ergonomics.\n- Highlight where to start reviewing and key design choices.\n- Call out risky areas and validation performed.\n- Keep unrelated formatting noise out of functional CLs.\n\n6. Handle review comments constructively.\n- Classify feedback into required changes, nits, and optional suggestions.\n- Resolve clear items quickly.\n- For disagreement, discuss with evidence and design principles, then escalate if needed.\n- Update CL description when scope changed during review.\n\n7. Final submission checks.\n- Re-run relevant tests.\n- Confirm docs and release notes updates if behavior or operations changed.\n- Ensure no hidden coupling to unsubmitted dependent CLs.\n\n## Branching Logic\n- Reviewer says CL is too large: split before deep iteration unless explicitly pre-approved.\n- Change is emergency: allow temporary quality trade-offs, document follow-up fixes.\n- Refactor plus feature mixed: split unless tiny and clearly reviewable.\n- Disagreement stalls progress: move from comment thread to synchronous discussion, then document decision.\n\n## Completion Checklist\n- CL is conceptually focused and reviewable.\n- Description explains both what and why.\n- Tests and docs are updated appropriately.\n- Reviewer comments are resolved or clearly dispositioned.\n- Build remains healthy for each landed step.\n\n## Output Format\n- `CL Plan:` size/split strategy and dependency order.\n- `Description Draft:` first line + body.\n- `Test Plan:` what to run and why.\n- `Review Response Plan:` how to address each comment category.\n\n## Assets\n- Use [CL description template](./assets/cl-description-template.md) for first-line and body structure.\n\n## Extra References\n- Use [eng-practices map](./references/eng-practices-map.md) to select source docs by authoring situation.\n\n## References\n- `./references/eng-practices-full/review/developer/index.md`\n- `./references/eng-practices-full/review/developer/cl-descriptions.md`\n- `./references/eng-practices-full/review/developer/small-cls.md`\n- `./references/eng-practices-full/review/reviewer/standard.md`\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-03-07T12:49:19.754Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Code Review Agents needing efficient changelist management and review feedback response capabilities.","zh":"适用于需要高效变更列表管理和审查反馈响应能力的代码审查代理。","ja":"コードレビューエージェントが効率的な変更リスト管理とレビューのフィードバック対応機能を必要とする場合に適しています。","ko":"코드 리뷰 에이전트가 효율적인 변경 목록 관리 및 리뷰 피드백 응답 기능을 필요로 할 때 적합합니다.","es":"Perfecto para agentes de revisión de código que necesitan una gestión eficiente de listas de cambios y capacidades de respuesta de comentarios de revisión.","fr":"Parfait pour les agents de revue de code nécessitant une gestion efficace des listes de modifications et des capacités de réponse aux commentaires de revue.","de":"Perfekt für Code-Review-Agents, die eine effiziente Changelist-Verwaltung und Review-Feedback-Antwortfähigkeiten benötigen.","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes de Revisão de Código que precisam de gerenciamento eficiente de lista de alterações e capacidades de resposta a feedback de revisão.","ru":"Идеально для агентов по обзору кода, которым требуется эффективное управление списком изменений и возможности ответа на отзывы о коде.","ar":"مثالي للوكلاء الذين يقومون بمراجعة الشفرة البرمجية الذين يحتاجون إلى إدارة فعالة للقائمة المتغيرة وتقديم ملاحظات حول التعليقات"},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to generate review-friendly changelists and respond to feedback efficiently, leveraging technologies like SSH, SFTP, and bash to streamline the development process.","zh":"赋予代理生成面向审查的变更列表的能力，并利用SSH、SFTP和bash等技术高效地响应反馈，从而简化开发过程。","ja":"エージェントがレビュー対応の変更リストを生成し、SSH、SFTP、bashなどのテクノロジーを活用してフィードバックに効率的に対応できるようにし、開発プロセスを合理化します。","ko":"에이전트가 리뷰에 적합한 변경 목록을 생성하고 SSH, SFTP, bash 등의 기술을 활용하여 피드백에 효율적으로 응답할 수 있도록 하여 개발 프로세스를 간소화합니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a generar listas de cambios amigables con la revisión y a responder a los comentarios de forma eficiente, aprovechando tecnologías como SSH, SFTP y bash para optimizar el proceso de desarrollo.","fr":"Permet aux agents de générer des listes de modifications conviviales pour la revue et de répondre aux commentaires de manière efficace, en exploitant des technologies comme SSH, SFTP et bash pour rationaliser le processus de développement.","de":"Ermöglicht es Agenten, review-freundliche Changelisten zu generieren und effizient auf Kommentare zu reagieren, indem es Technologien wie SSH, SFTP und bash nutzt, um den Entwicklungsprozess zu rationalisieren.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a gerar listas de alterações amigáveis à revisão e responder a feedback de forma eficiente, aproveitando tecnologias como SSH, SFTP e bash para otimizar o processo de desenvolvimento.","ru":"Позволяет агентам создавать списки изменений, удобные для обзора, и отвечать на отзывы эффективно, используя технологии seperti SSH, SFTP и bash для оптимизации процесса разработки.","ar":"تمكّن الوكلاء من إنشاء قائمة بالتحديثات التي تتماشى مع متطلبات المراجعة و الاستجابة للتعليقات بفعالية، مستفيدة من التقنيات مثل SSH و SFTP و bash لتحسين عملية التطوير"},"useCases":{"en":["Automating changelist preparation for code reviews","Generating responses to reviewer comments and disputed points","Streamlining test status and documentation impact analysis"],"zh":["自动化代码审查的变更列表准备","生成对审查者评论和争议点的响应","简化测试状态和文档影响分析"],"ja":["コードレビューの変更リストの準備を自動化する","レビューアーのコメントや争点に対する対応を生成する","テスト状態やドキュメントの影響分析を合理化する"],"ko":["코드 리뷰를 위한 변경 목록 준비 자동화","리뷰어의 코멘트 및 논란점에 대한 응답 생성","테스트 상태 및 문서 영향 분석의 간소화"],"es":["Automatizar la preparación de listas de cambios para revisiones de código","Generar respuestas a comentarios de revisores y puntos disputados","Optimizar el análisis de estado de prueba y el impacto de la documentación"],"fr":["Automatiser la préparation des listes de modifications pour les revues de code","Générer des réponses aux commentaires des relecteurs et aux points litigieux","Rationaliser l''analyse de l''état des tests et de l''impact de la documentation"],"de":["Automatisieren der Vorbereitung von Changelisten für Code-Reviews","Generieren von Antworten auf Kommentare von Reviewern und strittigen Punkten","Optimieren der Teststatus- und Dokumentationsauswirkungsanalyse"],"pt":["Automating a preparação da lista de alterações para revisões de código","Gerando respostas a comentários de revisores e pontos disputados","Otimizando o status do teste e análise de impacto da documentação"],"ru":["Автоматизация подготовки списка изменений для обзора кода","Генерация ответов на комментарии рецензентов и спорные моменты","Оптимизация статуса тестирования и анализа воздействия на документацию"],"ar":["تأتمتة إعداد قائمة التحديثات للمراجعة البرمجية","توليد استجابات للتعليقات المقدمة من المراجعين والنقاط المتنازع عليها","تحسين حالة الاختبار وتحليل تأثير الوثائق"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires input on proposed change summary and intended user/developer impact","Dependent on current CL size and dependency chain information","Limited to English output language"],"zh":["需要拟议的变更摘要和预期用户/开发人员影响的输入","依赖于当前CL大小和依赖链信息","仅限于英文输出语言"],"ja":["提案された変更の概要と予想されるユーザー/開発者の影響に関する入力が必要","現在のCLサイズと依存関係チェーン情報に依存する","出力言語は英語のみ"],"ko":["제안된 변경 요약 및 예상 사용자/개발자 영향에 대한 입력이 필요","현재 CL 크기 및 의존성 체인 정보에 의존","출력 언어는 영어만 해당"],"es":["Requiere información sobre el resumen del cambio propuesto y el impacto previsto en el usuario/desarrollador","Depende del tamaño actual de la CL y de la información de la cadena de dependencias","Limitado al idioma de salida en inglés"],"fr":["Nécessite des informations sur le résumé du changement proposé et l''impact prévu sur l''utilisateur/développeur","Dépend de la taille actuelle de la CL et des informations de la chaîne de dépendances","Limité à la langue de sortie anglaise"],"de":["Benötigt Informationen über die Zusammenfassung des vorgeschlagenen Changes und die beabsichtigte Auswirkung auf den Benutzer/Entwickler","Hängt von der aktuellen CL-Größe und der Abhängigkeitskettinformation ab","Begrenzt auf englische Ausgabesprache"],"pt":["Exige entrada sobre o resumo das alterações propostas e o impacto pretendido no usuário/desenvolvedor","Depende do tamanho atual da CL e informações da cadeia de dependência","Limitado à língua de saída em inglês"],"ru":["Требует ввода информации о предлагаемом обновлении и предполагаемом воздействии на пользователя/разработчика","Зависит от текущего размера CL и информации о цепочке зависимостей","Ограничен выводом на английском языке"],"ar":["يتطلب إدخال ملخص للتحديثات المقترحة وتأثيرها المتوقع على المستخدم / المطور","يعتمد على حجم CL الحالي ومعلومات سلسلة الاعتماد","محدود باللغة الإنجليزية كلغة إخراج"]},"version":4},"contentHash":"fa6fb07db6da0106f399b50fe7a1c6109d4f7cb2799d534a5876a0455ed8ad5f","qualityScore":41}');
