INSERT INTO skills_fts (id, name, owner, repo, category, search_text) VALUES ('agoudbg/Cosmosh/google-cl-author', 'google-cl-author', 'agoudbg', 'Cosmosh', 'community', 'google-cl-author agoudbg Cosmosh community agents ai bash cmd linux macos sftp sftp-client ssh ssh-agent ssh-client ssh-key ssh-key-manager ssh-server terminal windows windows-10 windows-11 zsh The google-cl-author skill helps developers prepare review-friendly changelists and respond to review feedback efficiently, supporting technologies like SSH, SFTP, and bash. Google CL Author Skill 是一种用于高效处理代码审查和反馈响应的工具，支持 SSH 和 SFTP Google CL Author Skill は、コードレビューとフィードバック対応を効率化するためのツールで、SSH と SFTP をサポート Google CL Author Skill은 코드 리뷰와 피드백 응대를 효율적으로 처리하는 도구로 SSH와 SFTP를 지원 Google-cl-author es una habilidad que ayuda a los desarrolladores a preparar listas de cambios y responder a comentarios de revisión de manera eficiente. Soporta SSH, SFTP y terminal Google-cl-author est une compétence qui aide les développeurs à préparer des listes de modifications et à répondre aux commentaires de révision de manière efficace. Prend en charge SSH, SFTP et terminal Google-cl-author ist eine Fähigkeit, die Entwicklern hilft, Änderungslisten vorzubereiten und Kommentare von Reviewern effizient zu beantworten. Unterstützt SSH, SFTP und Terminal O google-cl-author é uma ferramenta para preparar changelists e responder a feedback de revisão de forma eficiente, com suporte a SSH e SFTP google-cl-author - это инструмент для подготовки changelists и ответов на отзывы рецензентов, с поддержкой SSH и SFTP google-cl-author هو أداة لتحضير changelists والرد على تعليقات المراجعين بفعالية، مع دعم SSH و SFTP how to use google-cl-author google-cl-author setup guide google-cl-author alternative google-cl-author vs ssh-client what is google-cl-author google-cl-author install google-cl-author for AI agents google-cl-author and SFTP google-cl-author changelist management AIエージェント 代码审查工具 Google CL Author Skill SSH SFTP 代码审查 反馈响应 开发效率 Utilizes a balanced authoring profile for quality-first changelist preparation Supports SSH, SFTP, and bash for secure and efficient file transfers Generates review-friendly changelists with proposed change summaries and intended user impact Integrates with test status and documentation impact for comprehensive review feedback Manages open reviewer comments and disputed points for efficient collaboration google-cl-author is a skill that enables efficient changelist management, utilizing a balanced authoring profile and supporting English output language.');
