INSERT INTO skills_fts (id, name, owner, repo, category, search_text) VALUES ('lazyoft/raymond-invoices/implement-feature', 'implement-feature', 'lazyoft', 'raymond-invoices', 'community', 'implement-feature lazyoft raymond-invoices community The implement-feature skill helps developers create compliant features for Italian e-invoicing systems. It ensures conformity to Italian fiscal regulations. Implement-Feature技能用于开发电子发票系统的功能，确保符合意大利财税法规。该技能提供了开发指南和最佳实践 Implement-Featureスキルは、電子請求システムの機能を開発し、イタリアの財政法規制に準拠するために使用されます。このスキルは開発ガイドとベストプラクティスを提供します Implement-Feature 스킬은 전자 영수증 시스템의 기능을 개발하고 이탈리아의 재정법 규제에 준수하는 데 사용됩니다. 이 스킬은 개발 가이드와 최적의 관행을 제공합니다 Implementar características con validación de dominio para sistemas de facturación electrónica italiana. Conforme a la normativa fiscal italiana Mettre en œuvre des fonctionnalités avec validation de domaine pour les systèmes de facturation électronique italienne. Conforme à la réglementation fiscale italienne Implementierung von Funktionen mit Domänenvalidierung für italienische elektronische Rechnungssysteme. Konform mit der italienischen Steuergesetzgebung Implemente recursos com validação de domínio para sistemas de faturação eletrônica italiana, garantindo conformidade com a normativa fiscal Реализуйте функции с проверкой домена для электронных систем выставления счетов в Италии, обеспечивая соответствие фискальному законодательству نفذ الميزات مع التحقق من النطاق لنظم الفواتير الإلكترونية الإيطالية، وتأكد من مطابقتها للوائح المالية how to use implement-feature implement-feature setup guide Italian e-invoicing system development fiscal rules compliance for invoicing implement-feature alternative solutions domain validation for e-invoicing 电子发票系统 Implement-Feature技能 意大利财税法规 AI开发工具 电子发票系统开发 功能开发指南 Analyzes domain requirements using fiscal-rules.md Implements features conforming to Italian fiscal regulations Validates domain compliance for e-invoicing systems Follows a structured implementation flow for feature development References technical content from SKILL.md for accuracy Implement-feature is a specialized AI agent skill for developing features in Italian e-invoicing systems with domain validation and fiscal rules compliance.');
