contribute skills from their local branch to the upstream repository, following guidelines for sharing and documentation","zh":"Sharing Skills是一种允许开发者共享技能的功能，通过特定的工作流程和指南","ja":"Sharing Skillsは、開発者がスキルを共有できる機能で、特定のワークフローとガイドラインに従っています","ko":"Sharing Skills는 개발자가 기술을 공유할 수 있는 기능으로 특정 워크플로우 및 가이드 라인을 따릅니다","es":"Sharing Skills es una función que permite a los desarrolladores compartir habilidades ampliamente aplicables en un proyecto de antigravedad","fr":"Sharing Skills est une fonction qui permet aux développeurs de partager des compétences largement applicables dans un projet d''antigravité","de":"Sharing Skills ist eine Funktion, die es Entwicklern ermöglicht, weitgehend anwendbare Fähigkeiten in einem Antigravitationsprojekt zu teilen","pt":"Compartilhamento de habilidades é o processo de contribuir habilidades do seu ramo local para o repositório upstream","ru":"Обмен навыками - это процесс внесения навыков из вашей локальной ветки в репозиторий upstream","ar":"مشاركة المهارات هي عملية مساهمة المهارات من فرعك المحلي إلى المستودع الرئيسي"},"features":{"en":["Follows skills/meta/writing-skills guidelines for documentation","Supports branch, edit, commit, push, and PR workflow","Allows sharing of skills that apply broadly, not project-specific","Enables contribution of well-tested and documented skills","Integrates with upstream repository for skill sharing"],"zh":["遵循Branch → Edit/Create skill → Commit → Push → PR的工作流程","共享条件包括技能广泛适用、模式/技术有益、测试和文档齐全","遵循skills/meta/writing-skills指南","支持本地分支向上游仓库贡献技能","适用于广泛适用的技能共享"],"ja":["Branch → Edit/Create skill → Commit → Push → PRのワークフローに従う","共有条件には、スキルが広く適用可能、パターン/テクニックが有益、テストと文書化が完了していることが含まれる","skills/meta/writing-skillsガイドラインに従う","ローカルブランチからアップストリームリポジトリにスキルを貢献できる","広く適用可能なスキルの共有に適している"],"ko":["Branch → Edit/Create skill → Commit → Push → PR의 워크플로우를 따름","공유 조건에는 기술이 광범위하게 적용 가능하고 패턴/기술이 유용하며 테스트 및 문서화가 완료된 것이 포함","skills/meta/writing-skills 가이드 라인을 따름","로컬 분기에서 업스트림 저장소로 기술을 기여할 수 있음","광범위하게 적용 가능한 기술의 공유에 적합"],"es":["Flujo de trabajo de ramificación y edición de habilidades","Commit y push de cambios para compartir habilidades","Solicitud de extracción para revisar y aprobar habilidades","Compatibilidad con habilidades ampliamente aplicables","Seguimiento de las pautas de escritura de habilidades"],"fr":["Workflow de branchement et d''édition de compétences","Commit et push de modifications pour partager des compétences","Demande de pull pour examiner et approuver des compétences","Compatibilité avec des compétences largement applicables","Suivi des directives d''écriture de compétences"],"de":["Workflow für Verzweigung und Bearbeitung von Fähigkeiten","Commit und Push von Änderungen zum Teilen von Fähigkeiten","Pull-Anfrage zum Überprüfen und Genehmigen von Fähigkeiten","Kompatibilität mit weitgehend anwendbaren Fähigkeiten","Verfolgung der Richtlinien für die Erstellung von Fähigkeiten"],"pt":["Fluxo de trabalho Branch → Edit/Create skill → Commit → Push → PR","Compartilhamento de habilidades para repositório upstream","Documentação e testes bem feitos","Seguimento das diretrizes skills/meta/writing-skills"],"ru":["Рабочий процесс Branch → Edit/Create skill → Commit → Push → PR","Обмен навыками для репозитория upstream","Документация и тестирование","Следование рекомендациям skills/meta/writing-skills"],"ar":["تدفق العمل Branch → Edit/Create skill → Commit → Push → PR","مشاركة المهارات للمستودع الرئيسي","التوثيق والاختبار الجيد","التزام الإرشادات skills/meta/writing-skills"]},"keywords":{"en":["how to use Sharing Skills","what is Sharing Skills","Sharing Skills alternative","Sharing Skills vs GitHub","Sharing Skills install","Sharing Skills setup guide","contribute to upstream repository","skill sharing best practices","AI agent skill development"],"zh":["AIエージェント技能共享","Sharing Skills Setup Guide","AI工具技能共享","技能共享工作流程","技能共享条件","技能共享指南","本地分支向上游仓库贡献技能"],"ja":["AIエージェントスキル共有","Sharing Skills ベストプラクティス","AIツールスキル共有","スキル共有ワークフロー","スキル共有条件","スキル共有ガイドライン","ローカルブランチからアップストリームリポジトリにスキルを貢献"],"ko":["AI 에이전트 기술 공유","Sharing Skills 구축 가이드","AI 도구 기술 공유","기술 공유 워크플로우","기술 공유 조건","기술 공유 가이드 라인","로컬 분기에서 업스트림 저장소로 기술을 기여"],"es":["Sharing Skills","Agentes de IA","Herramientas de IA","Desarrollo de habilidades","Flujo de trabajo de desarrollo","Ramificación y edición de habilidades","Commit y push de cambios","Solicitud de extracción"],"fr":["Sharing Skills","Outils d''IA","Développement de compétences","Workflow de développement","Branchement et édition de compétences","Commit et push de modifications","Demande de pull"],"de":["Sharing Skills","KI-Agents","KI-Tools","Fähigkeitsentwicklung","Entwicklungsworkflow","Verzweigung und Bearbeitung von Fähigkeiten","Commit und Push von Änderungen","Pull-Anfrage"],"pt":["compartilhamento de habilidades","fluxo de trabalho","repositório upstream","documentação","testes","skills/meta/writing-skills","desenvolvimento de software","ferramentas de desenvolvimento"],"ru":["обмен навыками","рабочий процесс","репозиторий upstream","документация","тестирование","skills/meta/writing-skills","разработка программного обеспечения","инструменты разработки"],"ar":["مشاركة المهارات","تدفق العمل","المستودع الرئيسي","التوثيق","الاختبار","skills/meta/writing-skills","تطوير البرمجيات","أدوات التطوير"]}},"owner":"ITATA93","repo":"G_DeepResearch_Salud_Chile","repoPath":"ITATA93/G_DeepResearch_Salud_Chile","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-03-02T08:32:18Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"Sharing Skills","description":"Contribute skills back to upstream via branch and PR","version":"2.1.0","bodyPreview":"# Sharing Skills\n\n## Overview\n\nContribute skills from your local branch back to the upstream repository.\n\n**Workflow:** Branch → Edit/Create skill → Commit → Push → PR\n\n## When to Share\n\n**Share when:**\n- Skill applies broadly (not project-specific)\n- Pattern/technique others would benefit from\n- Well-tested and documented\n- Follows skills/meta/writing-skills guidelines\n\n**Keep personal when:**\n- Project-specific or organization-specific\n- Experimental or unstable\n- Contains sensitive informatio","body":"# Sharing Skills\n\n## Overview\n\nContribute skills from your local branch back to the upstream repository.\n\n**Workflow:** Branch → Edit/Create skill → Commit → Push → PR\n\n## When to Share\n\n**Share when:**\n- Skill applies broadly (not project-specific)\n- Pattern/technique others would benefit from\n- Well-tested and documented\n- Follows skills/meta/writing-skills guidelines\n\n**Keep personal when:**\n- Project-specific or organization-specific\n- Experimental or unstable\n- Contains sensitive information\n- Too narrow/niche for general use\n\n## Prerequisites\n\n- `gh` CLI installed and authenticated\n- Working directory is `~/.config/superpowers/skills/` (your local clone)\n- Skill has been tested (see skills/meta/writing-skills for TDD process)\n\n## Sharing Workflow\n\n### 1. Ensure You''re on Main and Synced\n\n```bash\ncd ~/.config/superpowers/skills/\ngit checkout main\ngit pull upstream main\ngit push origin main  # Push to your fork\n```\n\n### 2. Create Feature Branch\n\n```bash\n# Branch name: add-skillname-skill\nskill_name=\"your-skill-name\"\ngit checkout -b \"add-${skill_name}-skill\"\n```\n\n### 3. Create or Edit Skill\n\n```bash\n# Work on your skill in skills/\n# Create new skill or edit existing one\n# Skill should be in skills/category/skill-name/SKILL.md\n```\n\n### 4. Commit Changes\n\n```bash\n# Add and commit\ngit add skills/your-skill-name/\ngit commit -m \"Add ${skill_name} skill\n\n$(cat <<''EOF''\nBrief description of what this skill does and why it''s useful.\n\nTested with: [describe testing approach]\nEOF\n)\"\n```\n\n### 5. Push to Your Fork\n\n```bash\ngit push -u origin \"add-${skill_name}-skill\"\n```\n\n### 6. Create Pull Request\n\n```bash\n# Create PR to upstream using gh CLI\ngh pr create \\\n  --repo upstream-org/upstream-repo \\\n  --title \"Add ${skill_name} skill\" \\\n  --body \"$(cat <<''EOF''\n## Summary\nBrief description of the skill and what problem it solves.\n\n## Testing\nDescribe how you tested this skill (pressure scenarios, baseline tests, etc.).\n\n## Context\nAny additional context about why this skill is needed and how it should be used.\nEOF\n)\"\n```\n\n## Complete Example\n\nHere''s a complete example of sharing a skill called \"async-patterns\":\n\n```bash\n# 1. Sync with upstream\ncd ~/.config/superpowers/skills/\ngit checkout main\ngit pull upstream main\ngit push origin main\n\n# 2. Create branch\ngit checkout -b \"add-async-patterns-skill\"\n\n# 3. Create/edit the skill\n# (Work on skills/async-patterns/SKILL.md)\n\n# 4. Commit\ngit add skills/async-patterns/\ngit commit -m \"Add async-patterns skill\n\nPatterns for handling asynchronous operations in tests and application code.\n\nTested with: Multiple pressure scenarios testing agent compliance.\"\n\n# 5. Push\ngit push -u origin \"add-async-patterns-skill\"\n\n# 6. Create PR\ngh pr create \\\n  --repo upstream-org/upstream-repo \\\n  --title \"Add async-patterns skill\" \\\n  --body \"## Summary\nPatterns for handling asynchronous operations correctly in tests and application code.\n\n## Testing\nTested with multiple application scenarios. Agents successfully apply patterns to new code.\n\n## Context\nAddresses common async pitfalls like race conditions, improper error handling, and timing issues.\"\n```\n\n## After PR is Merged\n\nOnce your PR is merged:\n\n1. Sync your local main branch:\n```bash\ncd ~/.config/superpowers/skills/\ngit checkout main\ngit pull upstream main\ngit push origin main\n```\n\n2. Delete the feature branch:\n```bash\ngit branch -d \"add-${skill_name}-skill\"\ngit push origin --delete \"add-${skill_name}-skill\"\n```\n\n## Troubleshooting\n\n**\"gh: command not found\"**\n- Install GitHub CLI: https://cli.github.com/\n- Authenticate: `gh auth login`\n\n**\"Permission denied (publickey)\"**\n- Check SSH keys: `gh auth status`\n- Set up SSH: https://docs.github.com/en/authentication\n\n**\"Skill already exists\"**\n- You''re creating a modified version\n- Consider different skill name or coordinate with the skill''s maintainer\n\n**PR merge conflicts**\n- Rebase on latest upstream: `git fetch upstream && git rebase upstream/main`\n- Resolve conflicts\n- Force push: `git push -f origin your-branch`\n\n## Multi-Skill Contributions\n\n**Do NOT batch multiple skills in one PR.**\n\nEach skill should:\n- Have its own feature branch\n- Have its own PR\n- Be independently reviewable\n\n**Why?** Individual skills can be reviewed, iterated, and merged independently.\n\n## Related Skills\n\n- **skills/meta/writing-skills** - How to create well-tested skills\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-03-07T13:05:58.770Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Ideal for Collaborative AI Agents seeking to contribute and share skills across repositories.","zh":"适用于寻求跨存储库共享和贡献技能的协作 AI 代理的理想选择。","ja":"リポジトリ間でスキルを共有し貢献したいコラボレーションAIエージェントに最適。","ko":"저장소 간에 스킬을 공유하고 기여하고자 하는 협업 AI 에이전트에게 적합합니다.","es":"Ideal para agentes de IA colaborativa que buscan contribuir y compartir habilidades en varios repositorios.","fr":"Idéal pour les agents d''IA collaboratifs qui cherchent à contribuer et à partager des compétences à travers des référentiels.","de":"Ideal für kollaborative KI-Agents, die zur Beitragsleistung und zum Teilen von Fähigkeiten über Repositorys hinweg suchen.","pt":"Ideal para Agentes de IA Colaborativos que buscam contribuir e compartilhar habilidades em repositórios.","ru":"Идеально для Коллаборативных ИИ-агентов, стремящихся внести свой вклад и поделиться навыками в репозиториях.","ar":"مثالي لعميل الذكاء الاصطناعي التعاوني الذي يسعى للمساهمة ومشاركة المهارات عبر المستودعات."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to contribute skills from their local branch to the upstream repository, following a Git workflow of branch, edit, commit, push, and PR, utilizing skills/meta/writing-skills guidelines for well-tested and documented skills.","zh":"赋予代理从其本地分支向上游存储库贡献技能的能力，遵循 Git 工作流程中的分支、编辑、提交、推送和 PR，利用 skills/meta/writing-skills 指南创建经过良好测试和文档记录的技能。","ja":"エージェントがローカルブランチからアップストリームリポジトリにスキルをコントリビュートする力を与え、Gitのワークフローであるブランチ、編集、コミット、プッシュ、PRに従い、スキルをよくテスト・文書化するためのskills/meta/writing-skillsガイドラインを利用する。","ko":"에이전트가 로컬 브랜치에서 업스트림 저장소로 스킬을 기여할 수 있는 능력을 부여하여 Git 워크플로우인 브랜치, 편집, 커밋, 푸시, PR를 따르며 잘 테스트되고 문서화된 스킬을 위한 skills/meta/writing-skills 지침을 사용합니다.","es":"Permite a los agentes contribuir habilidades desde su rama local al repositorio upstream, siguiendo un flujo de trabajo Git de rama, edición, confirmación, envío y PR, utilizando las pautas skills/meta/writing-skills para habilidades bien probadas y documentadas.","fr":"Permet aux agents de contribuer des compétences depuis leur branche locale au référentiel upstream, en suivant un flux de travail Git de branche, édition, validation, publication et PR, en utilisant les lignes directrices skills/meta/writing-skills pour des compétences bien testées et documentées.","de":"Ermöglicht es den Agents, Fähigkeiten von ihrem lokalen Branch zum upstream-Repository beizutragen, indem sie einen Git-Arbeitsablauf von Branch, Bearbeitung, Commit, Push und PR befolgen und die Richtlinien skills/meta/writing-skills für gut getestete und dokumentierte Fähigkeiten nutzen.","pt":"Habilita agentes a contribuir habilidades da sua branch local para o repositório upstream, seguindo um fluxo de trabalho Git de branch, edição, commit, push e PR, utilizando as diretrizes skills/meta/writing-skills para habilidades bem testadas e documentadas.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью внести свой вклад в навыки из их локальной ветки в репозиторий upstream, следующий за рабочим процессом Git ветки, редактирования, фиксации, публикации и PR, используя руководство skills/meta/writing-skills для хорошо протестированных и задокументированных навыков.","ar":"تمكين العميل من المساهمة في المهارات من فرعه المحلي إلى المستودع الرئيسي، متبعًا تدفق عمل Git لفرع و تحرير و الالتزام و دفع و PR، باستخدام إرشادات skills/meta/writing-skills للمهارات التي تم اختبارها جيدًا و توثيقها."},"useCases":{"en":["Sharing broadly applicable skills","Contributing well-tested skills to upstream repositories","Collaborating on skill development through PR reviews"],"zh":["广泛适用的技能共享","向上游存储库贡献经过良好测试的技能","通过PR审查协作开发技能"],"ja":["広く適用可能なスキルの共有","よくテストされたスキルをアップストリームリポジトリにコントリビュート","PRレビューを介したスキル開発のコラボレーション"],"ko":["넓게 적용 가능한 스킬 공유","잘 테스트된 스킬을 업스트림 저장소에 기여","PR 리뷰를 통한 스킬 개발 협업"],"es":["Compartir habilidades ampliamente aplicables","Contribuir habilidades bien probadas a los repositorios upstream","Colaborar en el desarrollo de habilidades a través de revisiones de PR"],"fr":["Partager des compétences largement applicables","Contribuer des compétences bien testées aux référentiels upstream","Collaborer au développement de compétences via des révisions de PR"],"de":["Breit anwendbare Fähigkeiten teilen","Gut getestete Fähigkeiten zu den upstream-Repositorys beitragen","Bei der Entwicklung von Fähigkeiten durch PR-Überprüfungen kollaborieren"],"pt":["Compartilhamento de habilidades amplamente aplicáveis","Contribuição de habilidades bem testadas para repositórios upstream","Colaboração no desenvolvimento de habilidades por meio de revisões de PR"],"ru":["Общий обмен навыками, применимыми в широком смысле","Внесение вклада в хорошо протестированные навыки в репозитории upstream","Сотрудничество в развитии навыков посредством обзоров PR"],"ar":["مشاركة المهارات القابلة للتطبيق على نطاق واسع","المساهمة في المهارات التي تم اختبارها جيدًا في المستودعات الرئيسية","التعاون في تطوير المهارات من خلال مراجعات PR"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires adherence to skills/meta/writing-skills guidelines","Limited to sharing non-project-specific and non-sensitive information skills"],"zh":["需要遵守 skills/meta/writing-skills 指南","仅限于共享非项目特定和非敏感信息技能"],"ja":["skills/meta/writing-skillsガイドラインに従う必要","プロジェクト特有でないかつ機密情報でないスキルの共有のみ"],"ko":["skills/meta/writing-skills 지침을 준수해야 함","프로젝트 특정 및 민감 정보가 아닌 스킬만 공유 가능"],"es":["Requiere adherirse a las pautas skills/meta/writing-skills","Limitado a compartir habilidades no específicas de proyectos y no sensibles"],"fr":["Nécessite de se conformer aux lignes directrices skills/meta/writing-skills","Limité au partage de compétences non spécifiques aux projets et non sensibles"],"de":["Erfordert die Einhaltung der Richtlinien skills/meta/writing-skills","Begrenzt auf das Teilen von nicht projektspezifischen und nicht sensiblen Fähigkeiten"],"pt":["Exige aderência às diretrizes skills/meta/writing-skills","Limitado ao compartilhamento de informações de habilidades não específicas de projeto e não sensíveis"],"ru":["Требует соблюдения руководства skills/meta/writing-skills","Ограничен обменом навыками, не связанных с конкретными проектами и не содержащими конфиденциальную информацию"],"ar":["يتطلب اتباع إرشادات skills/meta/writing-skills","محدود بمشاركة مهارات غير محددة للمشاريع و غير حساسة"]},"version":4},"contentHash":"c896e646f1ea27b6e897f55b732fb9e269365593df34071694d5d0ab68a2e888","qualityScore":41}');
