e IA que ayuda a implementar aplicaciones Next.js en Vercel, configurando variables de entorno y dominios personalizados","fr":"Le déploiement Vercel est un outil d''IA qui facilite la mise en production d''applications Next.js sur Vercel, en configurant des variables d''environnement et des domaines personnalisés","de":"Das Vercel-Deploy ist ein KI-Tool, das die Bereitstellung von Next.js-Anwendungen auf Vercel erleichtert, indem es Umgebungsvariablen und benutzerdefinierte Domains konfiguriert","pt":"O que é implantação Vercel? É um processo de configuração de aplicativos Next.js no Vercel","ru":"Что такое развертывание Vercel? Это процесс настройки приложений Next.js на платформе Vercel","ar":"ما هي أداة تحكم في الإعدادات لتحديث Vercel؟ وهي عملية ضبط التطبيقات Next.js على منصة Vercel"},"features":{"en":["Deploys Next.js 15 apps to separate Vercel projects","Configures environment variables for each project","Sets up custom domains for production deployments","Manages preview deployments for PRs","Handles production deployments on the main branch","Debugs build failures for efficient troubleshooting"],"zh":["自动化部署 Next.js 15 应用","环境变量配置","自定义域名设置","预览部署","生产部署","构建失败调试"],"ja":["Next.js 15 アプリの自動化デプロイ","環境変数の設定","カスタムドメインの設定","プレビューデプロイ","本番デプロイ","ビルド失敗のデバッグ"],"ko":["Next.js 15 애플리케이션 자동화 배포","환경 변수 설정","사용자 지정 도메인 설정","미리 보기 배포","생산 배포","빌드 실패 디버깅"],"es":["Implementación de aplicaciones Next.js en Vercel","Configuración de variables de entorno","Configuración de dominios personalizados","Soporte para implementaciones de vista previa para solicitudes de extracción","Implementaciones de producción en la rama principal","Depuración de errores de compilación"],"fr":["Déploiement d''applications Next.js sur Vercel","Configuration de variables d''environnement","Configuration de domaines personnalisés","Prise en charge des déploiements de prévisualisation pour les demandes d''extraction","Déploiements de production sur la branche principale","Débogage des erreurs de compilation"],"de":["Bereitstellung von Next.js-Anwendungen auf Vercel","Konfiguration von Umgebungsvariablen","Konfiguration von benutzerdefinierten Domains","Unterstützung für Vorschau-Implementierungen für Pull-Requests","Produktions-Implementierungen auf dem Hauptzweig","Fehlerbehebung bei Kompilierungsfehlern"],"pt":["Configuração de projetos Vercel separados","Definição de variáveis de ambiente","Configuração de domínios personalizados","Implantação de pré-visualização para PRs","Implantação de produção no branch principal"],"ru":["Настройка отдельных проектов Vercel","Определение переменных окружения","Настройка пользовательских доменов","Развертывание предварительного просмотра для PR","Развертывание生产 на основном ветке"],"ar":["إعداد مشاريع Vercel منفصلة","تحديد متغيرات البيئة","ضبط المجالات المخصصة","تحديث معاينة للمراجعات","تحديث الإنتاج على الفرع الرئيسي"]},"keywords":{"en":["how to use vercel-deployment","vercel-deployment setup guide","next.js deployment on vercel","vercel-deployment vs netlify","vercel-deployment install","debugging vercel-deployment build failures","vercel-deployment environment variables","custom domain setup with vercel-deployment","vercel-deployment for ridendine projects"],"zh":["Vercel 部署","Next.js 15","自动化部署","环境变量配置","自定义域名设置","预览部署","生产部署","构建失败调试","RidenDine 项目"],"ja":["Vercel デプロイメント","Next.js 15","自動化デプロイ","環境変数の設定","カスタムドメインの設定","プレビューデプロイ","本番デプロイ","ビルド失敗のデバッグ","RidenDine プロジェクト"],"ko":["Vercel 배포","Next.js 15","자동화 배포","환경 변수 설정","사용자 지정 도메인 설정","미리 보기 배포","생산 배포","빌드 실패 디버깅","RidenDine 프로젝트"],"es":["vercel deployment","next js vercel","implementación de vercel","configuración de variables de entorno vercel","dominios personalizados vercel","herramientas de ia para desarrolladores","agente de ia para vercel","desarrollo de aplicaciones next js"],"fr":["déploiement vercel","next js vercel","déploiement sur vercel","configuration de variables d''environnement vercel","domaines personnalisés vercel","outils d''ia pour développeurs","outil d''ia pour vercel","développement d''applications next js"],"de":["vercel bereitstellung","next js vercel","vercel implementierung","konfiguration von umgebungsvariablen vercel","benutzerdefinierte domains vercel","ki-tools für entwickler","ki-tool für vercel","entwicklung von next js anwendungen"],"pt":["implantação Vercel","Next.js","configuração de projetos","variáveis de ambiente","domínios personalizados","implantação de pré-visualização","implantação de produção","Vercel deployment","Next.js deployment"],"ru":["развертывание Vercel","Next.js","настройка проектов","переменные окружения","пользовательские домены","развертывание предварительного просмотра","развертывание производ","ИИ Агенты","Vercel развертывание"],"ar":["أداة تحكم في الإعدادات لتحديث Vercel","Next.js","إعداد مشاريع","متغيرات البيئة","المجالات المخصصة","تحديث معاينة","تحديث الإنتاج","أدوات الذكاء الاصطناعي","تحديث Vercel"]}},"owner":"Ritenoob","repo":"ridedine","repoPath":"Ritenoob/ridedine","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-27T11:44:29Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"vercel-deployment","description":"|","version":"1.1.0","bodyPreview":"# Vercel Deployment\r\n\r\n## Problem\r\n\r\nRidenDine has two Next.js 15 apps (web, admin) deployed to Vercel. Each needs separate Vercel projects, environment variables, and domain configuration. Preview deployments for PRs, production deployments on main branch.\r\n\r\n## Context / Trigger Conditions\r\n\r\nUse this skill when:\r\n- Deploying apps to production\r\n- Setting up new Vercel projects\r\n- Configuring environment variables\r\n- Debugging build failures\r\n- Setting up custom domains\r\n- Configuring preview","body":"# Vercel Deployment\r\n\r\n## Problem\r\n\r\nRidenDine has two Next.js 15 apps (web, admin) deployed to Vercel. Each needs separate Vercel projects, environment variables, and domain configuration. Preview deployments for PRs, production deployments on main branch.\r\n\r\n## Context / Trigger Conditions\r\n\r\nUse this skill when:\r\n- Deploying apps to production\r\n- Setting up new Vercel projects\r\n- Configuring environment variables\r\n- Debugging build failures\r\n- Setting up custom domains\r\n- Configuring preview deployments\r\n\r\n## Pattern 1: Vercel Project Setup\r\n\r\n**Create Vercel Project:**\r\n\r\n```bash\r\n# Install Vercel CLI\r\npnpm add -g vercel\r\n\r\n# Link web app\r\ncd apps/web\r\nvercel link\r\n\r\n# Link admin app\r\ncd apps/admin\r\nvercel link\r\n```\r\n\r\n**Project Configuration (vercel.json):**\n\nKeep per-app `vercel.json` minimal to allow Vercel''s Next.js builder to handle install/build.\n\n```json\n{\n  \"framework\": \"nextjs\"\n}\n```\n\r\n## Pattern 2: Environment Variables\r\n\r\n**Web App (.env.production):**\r\n\r\n```bash\r\nNEXT_PUBLIC_SUPABASE_URL=https://<project-id>.supabase.co\nNEXT_PUBLIC_SUPABASE_ANON_KEY=<production-anon-key>\nNEXT_PUBLIC_STRIPE_PUBLISHABLE_KEY=pk_live_...\r\nSTRIPE_SECRET_KEY=sk_live_...\n```\r\n\r\n**Set via Vercel Dashboard:**\r\n\r\n1. Dashboard → Project → Settings → Environment Variables\r\n2. Add each variable for Production, Preview, Development\r\n3. Redeploy to apply changes\r\n\r\n**Or via CLI:**\r\n\r\n```bash\r\nvercel env add NEXT_PUBLIC_SUPABASE_URL production\r\nvercel env add STRIPE_SECRET_KEY production\r\n```\r\n\r\n## Pattern 3: Deployment\r\n\r\n**Automatic Deployment:**\r\n\r\n```bash\r\n# Push to main → production deployment\r\ngit push origin main\r\n\r\n# Push to feature branch → preview deployment\r\ngit push origin feature/new-feature\r\n```\r\n\r\n**Manual Deployment:**\r\n\r\n```bash\r\ncd apps/web\r\nvercel --prod  # Deploy to production\r\nvercel         # Deploy to preview\r\n```\r\n\r\n## Pattern 4: Build Configuration\r\n\r\n**pnpm Monorepo Support:**\r\n\r\n```json\r\n// apps/web/package.json\r\n{\r\n  \"scripts\": {\r\n    \"build\": \"next build\",\r\n    \"dev\": \"next dev\",\r\n    \"start\": \"next start\"\r\n  }\r\n}\r\n```\r\n\r\n**Install Command (vercel.json):**\n\nDo not set this in per-app `vercel.json`. Leave install commands blank so Vercel runs pnpm from the repo root.\n\r\n## Pattern 5: Monorepo Root Directory Configuration (CRITICAL)\r\n\r\n**Problem: \"No Next.js version detected\" error**\r\n\r\nWhen deploying from a monorepo subdirectory, Vercel looks for `next` in the repository root''s `package.json`. It cannot be configured via `vercel.json` alone.\r\n\r\n**Solution: Set Root Directory via Dashboard**\r\n\r\n1. Deploy once (will fail with \"No Next.js version detected\")\r\n2. Go to Vercel Dashboard → Project → Settings → General\r\n3. Find \"Root Directory\" section → Click \"Edit\"\r\n4. Set to subdirectory path: `apps/admin` or `apps/web`\r\n5. Click \"Save\"\r\n6. Redeploy from Deployments tab\r\n\r\n**Alternative: GitHub Integration (Recommended for Free Tier)**\r\n\r\nGitHub integration auto-detects monorepo structure:\r\n\r\n1. Go to https://vercel.com/new\r\n2. Import GitHub repository\r\n3. Vercel shows \"Multiple apps detected\"\r\n4. Configure each app:\r\n   - **Name:** admin / web\r\n   - **Root Directory:** apps/admin / apps/web\r\n   - **Framework:** Next.js (auto-detected)\r\n    - **Build Command:** *(leave blank)*\n    - **Install Command:** *(leave blank)*\n5. Deploy both projects\r\n\r\n**Free Tier Strategy:**\r\n\r\n- ✅ **Separate projects** (admin + web) - Recommended\r\n  - 2 projects = 2 separate domains\r\n  - Independent deployments\r\n  - Easier environment variable management\r\n  - Both deployments count toward free tier quota\r\n\r\n- ❌ **Single project with routing** - NOT recommended\r\n  - Complex routing configuration\r\n  - Harder to manage separate domains\r\n  - No benefit on free tier\r\n\r\n## Debugging Build Failures\r\n\r\n**Issue: \"No Next.js version detected\"**\r\n\r\n**Cause:** Root Directory not configured for monorepo\r\n\r\n**Fix:** Set Root Directory to subdirectory path via Vercel dashboard (see Pattern 5)\r\n\r\n**Issue: Module not found**\r\n\r\nFix: Verify workspace dependencies installed, check tsconfig paths\r\n\r\n**Issue: Environment variable undefined**\r\n\r\nFix: Add to Vercel dashboard, redeploy\r\n\r\n**Issue: Build timeout**\r\n\r\nFix: Optimize build time, increase timeout in Vercel settings\r\n\r\n## References\r\n\r\n- Vercel docs: https://vercel.com/docs\r\n- Next.js deployment: https://nextjs.org/docs/deployment\r\n- Monorepo deployment: https://vercel.com/docs/concepts/monorepos\r\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-03-07T03:45:10.037Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Next.js Agents needing streamlined Vercel deployments with environment variable management and custom domain configurations.","zh":"适用于需要简化 Vercel 部署并管理环境变量和自定义域配置的 Next.js Agents。","ja":"Next.js エージェントが Vercel デプロイをストリームライン化し、環境変数の管理とカスタム ドメインの構成が必要な場合に最適。","ko":"Next.js 에이전트가 Vercel 배포를 간소화하고 환경 변수 및 사용자 지정 도메인 설정을 관리해야 하는 경우에 적합합니다.","es":"Perfecto para agentes de Next.js que necesitan implementaciones de Vercel optimizadas con gestión de variables de entorno y configuraciones de dominios personalizados.","fr":"Parfait pour les agents Next.js qui ont besoin de déploiements Vercel rationalisés avec une gestion des variables d''environnement et des configurations de domaine personnalisées.","de":"Perfekt für Next.js-Agents, die optimierte Vercel-Bereitstellungen mit Umgebungsvariable-Verwaltung und benutzerdefinierten Domain-Konfigurationen benötigen.","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes Next.js que precisam de implantações Vercel otimizadas com gerenciamento de variáveis de ambiente e configurações de domínio personalizadas.","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов Next.js, которым необходимы оптимизированные развертывания Vercel с управлением переменными среды и настройками пользовательских доменов.","ar":"مثالي للوكلاء Next.js الذين يحتاجون إلى عمليات نشر Vercel مبسطة مع إدارة متغيرات البيئة وتكوين المجالات المخصصة."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to deploy Next.js apps to Vercel, managing separate projects, environment variables, and domain configurations, while also handling preview deployments for PRs and production deployments on the main branch using Vercel projects.","zh":"赋予代理部署 Next.js 应用到 Vercel 的能力，管理独立的项目、环境变量和域配置，同时也处理 PR 的预览部署和主分支的生产部署，使用 Vercel 项目。","ja":"エージェントに Next.js アプリを Vercel にデプロイする能力を与え、独立したプロジェクト、環境変数、ドメイン構成を管理し、PR のプレビュー デプロイとメイン ブランチのプロダクション デプロイも Vercel プロジェクトを使用して処理する。","ko":"에이전트가 Next.js 애플리케이션을 Vercel에 배포 할 수있는 능력을 부여하여 별도의 프로젝트, 환경 변수 및 도메인 구성 관리 및 PR의预览 배포 및 메인 브랜치의 프로덕션 배포를 Vercel 프로젝트를 사용하여 처리합니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a implementar aplicaciones Next.js en Vercel, gestionando proyectos separados, variables de entorno y configuraciones de dominio, y también maneja implementaciones de vista previa para PR y implementaciones de producción en la rama principal utilizando proyectos de Vercel.","fr":"Permet aux agents de déployer des applications Next.js sur Vercel, en gérant des projets séparés, des variables d''environnement et des configurations de domaine, et gère également les déploiements de prévisualisation pour les PR et les déploiements de production sur la branche principale en utilisant des projets Vercel.","de":"Ermächtigt Agents, Next.js-Apps auf Vercel bereitzustellen, separate Projekte, Umgebungsvariablen und Domain-Konfigurationen zu verwalten und auch Vorschau-Bereitstellungen für PR und Produktionsbereitstellungen auf dem Hauptzweig mithilfe von Vercel-Projekten zu verwalten.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a implantar aplicativos Next.js no Vercel, gerenciando projetos separados, variáveis de ambiente e configurações de domínio, além de lidar com implantações de pré-visualização para PRs e implantações de produção no branch principal usando projetos Vercel.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью развертывать приложения Next.js в Vercel, управляя отдельными проектами, переменными среды и настройками домена, а также обрабатывая предварительные развертывания для PR и производственные развертывания в основной ветке с использованием проектов Vercel.","ar":"يمنح الوكلاء القدرة على نشر تطبيقات Next.js على Vercel، وإدارة مشاريع منفصلة ومتغيرات البيئة وتكوين المجالات، بالإضافة إلى التعامل مع عمليات النشر للمراجعة للمراسلات وعمليات النشر الإنتاجية على الفرع الرئيسي باستخدام مشاريع Vercel."},"useCases":{"en":["Deploying Next.js apps to production environments","Configuring environment variables for Vercel projects","Setting up custom domains for RidenDine projects"],"zh":["将 Next.js 应用部署到生产环境","为 Vercel 项目配置环境变量","为 RidenDine 项目设置自定义域"],"ja":["Next.js アプリをプロダクション環境にデプロイする","Vercel プロジェクトの環境変数を構成する","RidenDine プロジェクトのカスタム ドメインを設定する"],"ko":["Next.js 애플리케이션을 프로덕션 환경에 배포하는 것","Vercel 프로젝트에 대한 환경 변수 구성","RidenDine 프로젝트에 대한 사용자 지정 도메인 설정"],"es":["Implementar aplicaciones Next.js en entornos de producción","Configurar variables de entorno para proyectos de Vercel","Configurar dominios personalizados para proyectos de RidenDine"],"fr":["Déployer des applications Next.js dans des environnements de production","Configurer des variables d''environnement pour des projets Vercel","Configurer des domaines personnalisés pour des projets RidenDine"],"de":["Bereitstellen von Next.js-Apps in Produktionsumgebungen","Konfigurieren von Umgebungsvariablen für Vercel-Projekte","Einrichten von benutzerdefinierten Domains für RidenDine-Projekte"],"pt":["Implantação de aplicativos Next.js em ambientes de produção","Configuração de variáveis de ambiente para projetos Vercel","Configuração de domínios personalizados para projetos RidenDine"],"ru":["Развертывание приложений Next.js в производственных средах","Настройка переменных среды для проектов Vercel","Настройка пользовательских доменов для проектов RidenDine"],"ar":["نشر تطبيقات Next.js في بيئات الإنتاج","تكوين متغيرات البيئة لمشاريع Vercel","تكوين المجالات المخصصة لمشاريع RidenDine"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires Vercel account and project setup","Limited to Next.js 15 apps","Needs separate Vercel projects for each app"],"zh":["需要 Vercel 账户和项目设置","仅限 Next.js 15 应用","需要为每个应用程序设置单独的 Vercel 项目"],"ja":["Vercel アカウントとプロジェクト設定が必要","Next.js 15 アプリに限定","各アプリケーションに個別の Vercel プロジェクトを設定する必要がある"],"ko":["Vercel 계정 및 프로젝트 설정이 필요합니다.","Next.js 15 애플리케이션으로 제한","각 애플리케이션에 대해 별도의 Vercel 프로젝트를 설정해야 함"],"es":["Requiere una cuenta y configuración de proyecto de Vercel","Limitado a aplicaciones Next.js 15","Necesita proyectos de Vercel separados para cada aplicación"],"fr":["Nécessite un compte et une configuration de projet Vercel","Limité aux applications Next.js 15","Nécessite des projets Vercel séparés pour chaque application"],"de":["Benötigt ein Vercel-Konto und eine Projekt-Konfiguration","Begrenzt auf Next.js-15-Apps","Benötigt separate Vercel-Projekte für jede App"],"pt":["Exige conta e configuração de projeto Vercel","Limitado a aplicativos Next.js 15","Necessita de projetos Vercel separados para cada aplicativo"],"ru":["Требует учетной записи Vercel и настройки проекта","Ограничен приложениями Next.js 15","Требует отдельных проектов Vercel для каждого приложения"],"ar":["يتطلب حساب Vercel وإعداد مشروع","محدود بتطبيقات Next.js 15","يحتاج إلى مشاريع Vercel منفصلة لكل تطبيق"]},"version":4},"contentHash":"1a83a88fc484bdd3d07b1b88d6065b957609ae3e28b6ba30266ad51af084699f","qualityScore":41}');
