INSERT INTO skills_fts (id, name, owner, repo, category, search_text) VALUES ('jahnvi-maddila/monadblitzdenver/monad-development', 'monad-development', 'jahnvi-maddila', 'monadblitzdenver', 'community', 'monad-development jahnvi-maddila monadblitzdenver community Monad Development is a skill that enables AI agents to deploy contracts on Ethereum testnet and mainnet using Foundry framework. It benefits developers who need to verify contracts after deployment. Monad开发是一个使用Foundry框架的开发工具，支持testnet和mainnet网络 Monad開発はFoundryフレームワークを使用した開発ツールで、testnetとmainnetネットワークをサポートしています Monad 개발은 Foundry 프레임워크를 사용하는 개발 도구로 testnet와 mainnet 네트워크를 지원합니다 Monad-development es un framework para el desarrollo de contratos inteligentes que utiliza Foundry y testnet. Ofrece funcionalidades como verificación de contratos y persistencia de wallets Monad-development est un framework pour le développement de contrats intelligents qui utilise Foundry et testnet. Il offre des fonctionnalités telles que la vérification de contrats et la persistance de wallets Monad-development ist ein Framework für die Entwicklung von Smart Contracts, das Foundry und testnet verwendet. Es bietet Funktionen wie Vertragsverifizierung und Wallet-Persistenz O Monad Development é uma ferramenta para desenvolvedores que fornece uma configuração padrão para redes e verificação de contratos. Utiliza o framework Foundry e testnet por padrão. Monad Development - это инструмент для разработчиков, который предоставляет стандартную настройку для сетей и проверки контрактов. Использует фреймворк Foundry и testnet по умолчанию. Monad Development هو أداة للمطورين توفر إعدادًا افتراضيًا للشبكات والتحقق من العقود. يستخدم إطار العمل Foundry و testnet افتراضيًا. how to use monad development monad development setup guide foundry framework tutorial ethereum testnet deployment monad development vs hardhat monad development install what is monad development monad development best practices ethereum mainnet deployment with foundry Monad开发 Foundry框架 testnet网络 mainnet网络 智能合约开发 AI工具 开发设置指南 Deploys contracts on Ethereum testnet (chain ID 10143) by default Verifies contracts after deployment unless user specifies not to Uses Foundry framework for development and deployment Generates and persists wallets for secure transaction management Supports deployment on mainnet when user specifies Monad Development is a technical skill that provides a set of defaults and guidelines for developing on the Ethereum blockchain using Foundry framework.');
