どの機能を提供します。","ko":"Monad 개발은 특정 네트워크와 프레임워크를 사용하는 개발 도구로, 지갑 持久化와 검증 등의 기능을 제공합니다.","es":"Monad-development es un conjunto de herramientas para desarrolladores que facilita la creación y despliegue de contratos inteligentes en testnet","fr":"Monad-development est un ensemble d''outils pour les développeurs qui facilite la création et le déploiement de contrats intelligents sur testnet","de":"Monad-development ist eine Sammlung von Tools für Entwickler, die die Erstellung und Bereitstellung von Smart-Verträgen in testnet erleichtert","pt":"Monad Development é uma ferramenta de desenvolvimento que fornece configurações padrão para redes e verificação de contratos","ru":"Monad Development — это инструмент разработки, предоставляющий стандартные настройки для сетей и верификации контрактов для ИИ Агентов","ar":"Monad Development هو أداة تطوير توفر إعدادات افتراضية للشبكات والتحقق من العقود"},"features":{"en":["Deploys contracts on testnet with chain ID 10143","Verifies contracts after deployment by default","Utilizes Foundry framework for development","Persists generated wallets for secure management","Supports mainnet deployment when specified by the user","Fetches additional documentation from https://docs.monad.xyz/llms.txt"],"zh":["使用testnet（链ID 10143）进行开发","默认情况下验证合约","使用Foundry框架","提供_wallet持久化功能","支持mainnet和testnet网络"],"ja":["testnet（チェーンID 10143）を使用した開発","デフォルトでコントラクトを検証","Foundryフレームワークを使用","ウォレット永続化機能を提供","mainnetとtestnetの両方をサポート"],"ko":["testnet（체인 ID 10143）을 사용한 개발","기본적으로 계약을 검증","Foundry 프레임워크를 사용","지갑 持久化 기능을 제공","mainnet과 testnet의 두 가지 네트워크를 지원"],"es":["Utiliza Foundry como framework de desarrollo","Soporte para testnet con chain ID 10143","Verificación de contratos después de la implementación","Persistencia de wallets generadas","Soporte para mainnet con chain ID configurable"],"fr":["Utilise Foundry comme framework de développement","Prise en charge de testnet avec chain ID 10143","Vérification de contrats après le déploiement","Persistance des wallets générées","Prise en charge de mainnet avec chain ID configurable"],"de":["Verwendet Foundry als Entwicklungsfamework","Unterstützung für testnet mit Chain-ID 10143","Verifizierung von Verträgen nach der Bereitstellung","Persistenz von generierten Wallets","Unterstützung für mainnet mit konfigurierbarer Chain-ID"],"pt":["Utiliza testnet como padrão","Verificação de contratos após implantação","Utiliza framework Foundry","Persistência de carteiras","Suporte a mainnet"],"ru":["Использует testnet по умолчанию","Верификация контрактов после развертывания","Использует фреймворк Foundry","ПERSISTENCIA кошельков","Поддержка mainnet для ИИ Агентов"],"ar":["استخدام شبكة اختبار افتراضية","التحقق من العقود بعد النشر","استخدام إطار العمل Foundry","استمرارية المحفظة","دعم الشبكة الرئيسية"]},"keywords":{"en":["how to use monad-development","monad-development setup guide","what is monad-development","monad-development vs hardhat","monad-development install","monad-development tutorial for AI agents","foundry framework integration","testnet contract deployment"],"zh":["Monad开发","AIエージェント工具","Foundry框架","testnet开发","合约验证","Wallet持久化","Monad开发设置","AI开发工具"],"ja":["Monad開発","AIエージェント","Foundryフレームワーク","testnet開発","コントラクト検証","ウォレット永続化","Monad開発ベストプラクティス","AI開発ツール"],"ko":["Monad 개발","AI 에이전트 도구","Foundry 프레임워크","testnet 개발","계약 검증","지갑 持久化","Monad 개발 가이드","AI 개발 도구"],"es":["desarrollo de monad","foundry","testnet","verificación de contratos","persistencia de wallets","mainnet","desarrollo de contratos inteligentes","herramientas de desarrollo de blockchain","monad-development"],"fr":["développement monad","foundry","testnet","vérification de contrats","persistance de wallets","mainnet","développement de contrats intelligents","outils de développement de blockchain","monad-development"],"de":["monad-entwicklung","foundry","testnet","verifizierung von verträgen","persistenz von wallets","mainnet","entwicklung von smart-verträgen","entwicklungstools für blockchain","monad-development"],"pt":["Monad Development","desenvolvimento de blockchain","testnet","mainnet","verificação de contratos","framework Foundry","persistência de carteiras","desenvolvedores de blockchain"],"ru":["Monad Development","Разработка блокчейна","testnet","mainnet","Верификация контрактов","Фреймворк Foundry","ПERSISTENCIA кошельков","Разработчики блокчейна ИИ Агентов"],"ar":["Monad Development","تطوير البلوكشين","شبكة اختبار","الشبكة الرئيسية","التحقق من العقود","إطار العمل Foundry","استمرارية المحفظة","مطورو البلوكشين"]}},"owner":"RyanL2","repo":"privamarket","repoPath":"RyanL2/privamarket","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-03-01T15:44:15Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"monad-development","description":"Builds dapps on Monad blockchain. Use when deploying contracts, setting up frontends with viem/wagmi, or verifying contracts on Monad testnet or mainnet.","version":"1.0.0","bodyPreview":"# Monad Development\n\nFor questions not covered here, fetch https://docs.monad.xyz/llms.txt\n\n## Quick Reference\n\n### Defaults\n- **Network:** Always use **testnet** (chain ID 10143) unless user says \"mainnet\"\n- **Verification:** Always verify contracts after deployment unless user says not to\n- **Framework:** Use Foundry (not Hardhat)\n- **Wallet:** If you generate a wallet, MUST persist it (see Wallet Persistence section)\n\n### Networks\n\n| Network | Chain ID | RPC |\n|---------|----------|-----|\n| T","body":"# Monad Development\n\nFor questions not covered here, fetch https://docs.monad.xyz/llms.txt\n\n## Quick Reference\n\n### Defaults\n- **Network:** Always use **testnet** (chain ID 10143) unless user says \"mainnet\"\n- **Verification:** Always verify contracts after deployment unless user says not to\n- **Framework:** Use Foundry (not Hardhat)\n- **Wallet:** If you generate a wallet, MUST persist it (see Wallet Persistence section)\n\n### Networks\n\n| Network | Chain ID | RPC |\n|---------|----------|-----|\n| Testnet | 10143 | https://testnet-rpc.monad.xyz |\n| Mainnet | 143 | https://rpc.monad.xyz |\n\nDocs: https://docs.monad.xyz\n\n### Explorers\n\n| Explorer | Testnet | Mainnet |\n|----------|---------|---------|\n| Socialscan | https://monad-testnet.socialscan.io | https://monad.socialscan.io |\n| MonadVision | https://testnet.monadvision.com | https://monadvision.com |\n| Monadscan | https://testnet.monadscan.com | https://monadscan.com |\n\n### Agent APIs\n\n**IMPORTANT:** Do NOT use a browser. Use these APIs directly with curl.\n\n**Faucet (Testnet Funding):**\n```bash\ncurl -X POST https://agents.devnads.com/v1/faucet \\\n  -H \"Content-Type: application/json\" \\\n  -d ''{\"chainId\": 10143, \"address\": \"0xYOUR_ADDRESS\"}''\n```\n\nReturns: `{\"txHash\": \"0x...\", \"amount\": \"1000000000000000000\", \"chain\": \"Monad Testnet\"}`\n\n**Fallback (official faucet):** https://faucet.monad.xyz\nIf the agent faucet fails, ask the user to fund via the official faucet (do not use a browser yourself).\n\n**Verification (All Explorers):**\n\nALWAYS use the verification API first. It verifies on all 3 explorers (MonadVision, Socialscan, Monadscan) with one call. Do NOT use `forge verify-contract` as first choice.\n\n```bash\n# 1. Get verification data\nforge verify-contract <ADDR> <CONTRACT> \\\n  --chain 10143 \\\n  --show-standard-json-input > /tmp/standard-input.json\n\ncat out/<Contract>.sol/<Contract>.json | jq ''.metadata'' > /tmp/metadata.json\nCOMPILER_VERSION=$(jq -r ''.metadata | fromjson | .compiler.version'' out/<Contract>.sol/<Contract>.json)\n\n# 2. Call verification API\nSTANDARD_INPUT=$(cat /tmp/standard-input.json)\nFOUNDRY_METADATA=$(cat /tmp/metadata.json)\n\ncat > /tmp/verify.json << EOF\n{\n  \"chainId\": 10143,\n  \"contractAddress\": \"0xYOUR_CONTRACT_ADDRESS\",\n  \"contractName\": \"src/MyContract.sol:MyContract\",\n  \"compilerVersion\": \"v${COMPILER_VERSION}\",\n  \"standardJsonInput\": $STANDARD_INPUT,\n  \"foundryMetadata\": $FOUNDRY_METADATA\n}\nEOF\n\ncurl -X POST https://agents.devnads.com/v1/verify \\\n  -H \"Content-Type: application/json\" \\\n  -d @/tmp/verify.json\n```\n\n**With constructor arguments:** Add `constructorArgs` (ABI-encoded, WITHOUT 0x prefix):\n```bash\nARGS=$(cast abi-encode \"constructor(string,string,uint256)\" \"MyToken\" \"MTK\" 1000000000000000000000000)\nARGS_NO_PREFIX=${ARGS#0x}\n# Add to request: \"constructorArgs\": \"$ARGS_NO_PREFIX\"\n```\n\n**Manual verification fallback (if API fails):**\n```bash\nforge verify-contract <ADDR> <CONTRACT> --chain 10143 \\\n  --verifier sourcify \\\n  --verifier-url \"https://sourcify-api-monad.blockvision.org/\"\n```\n\n## Wallet Persistence\n\n**CRITICAL for agents:** If you generate a wallet for the user, you MUST persist it for future use.\n\nWhen generating a new wallet:\n1. Create wallet: `cast wallet new`\n2. **Immediately save** the address and private key to a secure location\n3. Inform the user where the wallet details are stored\n4. Fund the wallet via faucet before deployment\n\n**Storage options:**\n- Write to `~/.monad-wallet` with chmod 600\n- Store in a project-specific `.env` file (add to .gitignore)\n- Return credentials to user and ask them to save securely\n\n**Why this matters:** Users need access to their wallet to:\n- Deploy additional contracts\n- Interact with deployed contracts\n- Manage funds\n- Verify ownership\n\n## Deployment Workflow\n\nUse `forge script` for deployments:\n\n```bash\nforge script script/Deploy.s.sol:DeployScript \\\n  --rpc-url https://testnet-rpc.monad.xyz \\\n  --private-key $PRIVATE_KEY \\\n  --broadcast\n```\n\n**Deploy script template:**\n\n```solidity\n// SPDX-License-Identifier: MIT\npragma solidity ^0.8.27;\nimport \"forge-std/Script.sol\";\nimport \"../src/MyContract.sol\";\n\ncontract DeployScript is Script {\n    function run() external {\n        vm.startBroadcast();\n        MyContract contract = new MyContract();\n        console.log(\"Contract deployed at:\", address(contract));\n        vm.stopBroadcast();\n    }\n}\n```\n\n## Technical Details\n\n### EVM Version (Critical)\n\nAlways set `evmVersion: \"prague\"`. Requires Solidity 0.8.27+.\n\n**Foundry** (`foundry.toml`):\n```toml\n[profile.default]\nevm_version = \"prague\"\nsolc_version = \"0.8.28\"\n```\n\n### Foundry Tips\n\n**Flags that don''t exist (don''t use):**\n- `--no-commit` - not a valid flag for `forge init` or `forge install`\n\n**Deployment - use `forge script`, NOT `forge create`:**\n\n`forge create --broadcast` is buggy and often ignored. Use `forge script` instead.\n\n```bash\nforge script script/Deploy.s.sol:DeployScript \\\n  --rpc-url https://testnet-rpc.monad.xyz \\\n  --private-key $PRIVATE_KEY \\\n  --broadcast\n```\n\n**Deploy script must NOT hardcode addresses:**\n\n```solidity\n// ✅ Correct - reads private key from --private-key flag\nfunction run() external {\n    vm.startBroadcast();\n    new MyContract();\n    vm.stopBroadcast();\n}\n\n// ❌ Wrong - hardcodes address, causes \"No associated wallet\" error\nfunction run() external {\n    vm.startBroadcast(0x1234...);\n}\n```\n\n### Frontend\n\nImport from `viem/chains`. Do NOT define custom chain:\n\n```ts\nimport { monadTestnet } from \"viem/chains\";\n```\n\nUse with wagmi:\n\n```ts\nimport { createConfig, http } from ''wagmi''\nimport { monadTestnet } from ''viem/chains''\n\nconst config = createConfig({\n  chains: [monadTestnet],\n  transports: {\n    [monadTestnet.id]: http()\n  }\n})\n```\n\n## Example: Deploy ERC20\n\n**1. Create project:**\n```bash\nforge init my-token\ncd my-token\n```\n\n**2. Configure `foundry.toml`:**\n```toml\n[profile.default]\nsrc = \"src\"\nout = \"out\"\nlibs = [\"lib\"]\nevm_version = \"prague\"\nsolc_version = \"0.8.28\"\n```\n\n**3. Create contract `src/MyToken.sol`:**\n```solidity\n// SPDX-License-Identifier: MIT\npragma solidity ^0.8.27;\n\nimport \"@openzeppelin/contracts/token/ERC20/ERC20.sol\";\n\ncontract MyToken is ERC20 {\n    constructor(uint256 initialSupply) ERC20(\"MyToken\", \"MTK\") {\n        _mint(msg.sender, initialSupply);\n    }\n}\n```\n\n**4. Install dependencies:**\n```bash\nforge install OpenZeppelin/openzeppelin-contracts --no-commit\n```\n\n**5. Create deploy script `script/Deploy.s.sol`:**\n```solidity\n// SPDX-License-Identifier: MIT\npragma solidity ^0.8.27;\nimport \"forge-std/Script.sol\";\nimport \"../src/MyToken.sol\";\n\ncontract DeployScript is Script {\n    function run() external {\n        vm.startBroadcast();\n        MyToken token = new MyToken(1000000 * 10**18);\n        console.log(\"Token deployed at:\", address(token));\n        vm.stopBroadcast();\n    }\n}\n```\n\n**6. Deploy:**\n```bash\nforge script script/Deploy.s.sol:DeployScript \\\n  --rpc-url https://testnet-rpc.monad.xyz \\\n  --private-key $PRIVATE_KEY \\\n  --broadcast\n```\n\n**7. Verify:**\n```bash\n# Use verification API (verifies on all explorers)\nSTANDARD_INPUT=$(forge verify-contract <TOKEN_ADDRESS> src/MyToken.sol:MyToken --chain 10143 --show-standard-json-input)\nCOMPILER_VERSION=$(jq -r ''.metadata | fromjson | .compiler.version'' out/MyToken.sol/MyToken.json)\n\ncurl -X POST https://agents.devnads.com/v1/verify \\\n  -H \"Content-Type: application/json\" \\\n  -d \"{\n    \\\"chainId\\\": 10143,\n    \\\"contractAddress\\\": \\\"<TOKEN_ADDRESS>\\\",\n    \\\"contractName\\\": \\\"src/MyToken.sol:MyToken\\\",\n    \\\"compilerVersion\\\": \\\"v${COMPILER_VERSION}\\\",\n    \\\"standardJsonInput\\\": $STANDARD_INPUT,\n    \\\"constructorArgs\\\": \\\"$(cast abi-encode ''constructor(uint256)'' 1000000000000000000000000 | sed ''s/0x//'')\\\"\n  }\"\n```\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-03-07T04:01:20.376Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Ideal for Smart Contract Agents requiring streamlined testnet deployment and verification using Foundry","zh":"适用于需要使用Foundry进行流线化测试网络部署和验证的智能合约代理","ja":"Foundryを使用したテストネットのストリームライン化されたデプロイと検証を必要とするスマートコントラクトエージェントに適しています","ko":"Foundry를 사용하여 테스트 네트워크를 스트리밍 형태로 배포하고 검증해야 하는 스마트 계약 에이전트에 적합합니다","es":"Ideal para Agentes de Contrato Inteligente que requieren una implementación y verificación de testnet simplificadas utilizando Foundry","fr":"Idéal pour les agents de contrat intelligent nécessitant un déploiement et une vérification de testnet rationalisés utilisant Foundry","de":"Ideal für Smart Contract Agents, die eine gestreamte Testnet-Bereitstellung und -verifizierung mit Foundry erfordern","pt":"Ideal para Agentes de Contrato Inteligente que requerem implantação e verificação de testnet otimizadas usando Foundry","ru":"Идеально для агентов умных контрактов, требующих оптимизированной развертки и верификации тестовой сети с помощью Foundry","ar":"مثالي لعميل عقود ذكية يتطلب تثبيت وتحقق شبكة اختبار مجدولة باستخدام Foundry"},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to deploy and verify contracts on testnet with wallet persistence, leveraging the Foundry framework for efficient development and RPC connections for seamless network interactions","zh":"赋予代理在测试网络上部署和验证合约的能力，实现钱包持久性，并利用Foundry框架进行高效开发和RPC连接以实现无缝网络交互","ja":"テストネット上でコントラクトをデプロイして検証するエージェントの能力を高め、ウォレットの永続性を実現し、Foundryフレームワークを使用した効率的な開発とRPC接続を使用してシームレスなネットワークのやり取りを可能にします","ko":"에이전트가 테스트 네트워크에서 계약을 배포하고 검증할 수 있는 능력을 부여하고 지갑의 영속성을 실현하며 Foundry 프레임워크를 사용한 효율적인 개발과 RPC 연결을 사용하여 무결점 네트워크 상호작용을 가능하게 합니다","es":"Habilita a los agentes a implementar y verificar contratos en testnet con persistencia de billetera, utilizando el marco de trabajo Foundry para un desarrollo eficiente y conexiones RPC para interacciones de red sin problemas","fr":"Permet aux agents de déployer et de vérifier des contrats sur testnet avec une persistance de portefeuille, en exploitant le framework Foundry pour un développement efficace et des connexions RPC pour des interactions réseau sans problème","de":"Ermächtigt Agenten, Verträge auf Testnet mit Wallet-Persistenz bereitzustellen und zu verifizieren, indem es das Foundry-Framework für eine effiziente Entwicklung und RPC-Verbindungen für nahtlose Netzwerkinteraktionen nutzt","pt":"Habilita agentes a implantar e verificar contratos em testnet com persistência de carteira, aproveitando o framework Foundry para desenvolvimento eficiente e conexões RPC para interações de rede sem interrupção","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью развертывать и верифицировать контракты в тестовой сети с сохранением кошелька, используя фреймворк Foundry для эффективного развития и RPC-соединений для бесперебойного взаимодействия с сетью","ar":"يمنح الوكلاء القدرة على نشر العقود وتحققها على شبكة الاختبار مع استمرار الحافظة، مستفيدا من إطار Foundry من أجل التطوير الفعال والاتصالات RPC من أجل التفاعلات الشبكية دون انقطاع"},"useCases":{"en":["Deploying contracts on testnet with automatic verification","Generating and persisting wallets for secure transaction management","Streamlining contract development using Foundry and testnet RPC connections"],"zh":["在测试网络上自动化验证部署合约","生成和持久化钱包以实现安全的交易管理","使用Foundry和测试网络RPC连接简化合约开发"],"ja":["自動検証でテストネット上にコントラクトをデプロイする","セキュアなトランザクション管理のためにウォレットを生成して永続化する","FoundryとテストネットのRPC接続を使用してコントラクト開発を効率化する"],"ko":["자동 검증으로 테스트 네트워크에 계약을 배포하는 것","안전한 트랜잭션 관리를 위해 지갑을 생성하고 영속화하는 것","Foundry와 테스트 네트워크 RPC 연결을 사용하여 계약 개발을 간소화하는 것"],"es":["Implementar contratos en testnet con verificación automática","Generar y persistir billeteras para una gestión de transacciones segura","Racionalizar el desarrollo de contratos utilizando Foundry y conexiones RPC de testnet"],"fr":["Déployer des contrats sur testnet avec vérification automatique","Générer et persister des portefeuilles pour une gestion de transactions sécurisée","Rationaliser le développement de contrats en utilisant Foundry et des connexions RPC de testnet"],"de":["Verträge auf Testnet mit automatischer Verifizierung bereitstellen","Brieftaschen generieren und persistieren, um eine sichere Transaktionsverwaltung zu ermöglichen","Vertragseinstellungen mit Foundry und Testnet-RPC-Verbindungen rationalisieren"],"pt":["Implantação de contratos em testnet com verificação automática","Geração e persistência de carteiras para gerenciamento de transações seguro","Otimização do desenvolvimento de contratos usando Foundry e conexões RPC de testnet"],"ru":["Развертка контрактов в тестовой сети с автоматической верификацией","Генерация и сохранение кошельков для безопасного управления транзакциями","Оптимизация разработки контрактов с помощью Foundry и RPC-соединений тестовой сети"],"ar":["نشر العقود على شبكة الاختبار مع التحقق التلقائي","توليد واستمرار الحافظات لأدارة المعاملات الآمنة","تحسين تطوير العقود باستخدام إطار Foundry والاتصالات RPC لشبكة الاختبار"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires testnet setup with chain ID 10143","Limited to Foundry framework, not compatible with Hardhat","Wallet persistence mandatory for generated wallets"],"zh":["需要测试网络设置，链ID为10143","仅限Foundry框架，不兼容Hardhat","对于生成的钱包，钱包持久性是必需的"],"ja":["チェーンID 10143のテストネット設定が必要","Foundryフレームワークのみ、Hardhatと互換性がない","生成されたウォレットの場合、ウォレットの永続性が必須"],"ko":["체인 ID 10143의 테스트 네트워크 설정이 필요","Foundry 프레임워크만 사용 가능, Hardhat와 호환되지 않음","생성된 지갑의 경우 지갑 영속성이 필수"],"es":["Requiere configuración de testnet con ID de cadena 10143","Limitado al marco de trabajo Foundry, no compatible con Hardhat","La persistencia de billetera es obligatoria para las billeteras generadas"],"fr":["Nécessite une configuration de testnet avec un ID de chaîne 10143","Limité au framework Foundry, non compatible avec Hardhat","La persistance du portefeuille est obligatoire pour les portefeuilles générés"],"de":["Benötigt Testnet-Einrichtung mit Chain-ID 10143","Begrenzt auf das Foundry-Framework, nicht kompatibel mit Hardhat","Wallet-Persistenz ist für generierte Wallets obligatorisch"],"pt":["Requer configuração de testnet com ID de corrente 10143","Limitado ao framework Foundry, não compatível com Hardhat","Persistência de carteira obrigatória para carteiras geradas"],"ru":["Требуется настройка тестовой сети с ID цепи 10143","Ограничен фреймворком Foundry, несовместим с Hardhat","Сохранность кошелька обязательна для сгенерированных кошельков"],"ar":["يتطلب إعداد شبكة الاختبار مع معرف السلسلة 10143","محدود بإطار Foundry، غير متوافق مع Hardhat","استمرار الحافظة إجباري للحافظات المولدة"]},"version":4},"contentHash":"812e2be9ea275f6b8bfe17c37b011722d69aad9471efaadb2c1e7542a55c5afa","qualityScore":41}');
